goyle in the Into the River of Secrets, but she was still thrown off by the powerful jet of water. [Into the River of Secrets]\n\nSophie used it to stop two Boltflare attacks simultaneously. \n\nHonorguard was shown to be ineffective against the Nullcurse power used by the Blood Spiral. [The Blood Spiral]\n\nFocauld Casterwill used this spell at the Cloisters to deflect a Raypulse back at a Silent Soldier. [The Casterwill Connection]"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"* Although the spell is typically used by the [[Casterwill family]], Defoe was shown to use it, albeit silently. {{Source|S1E03}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"* Although the spell is typically used by the Casterwill family, Defoe was shown to use it, albeit silently. [S1E03]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS1E04 Sophie Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard to defend a water attack from the [[Gargoyle]]\nFile:S1E03 DeFoe Kreutalk Honorguard Zhalia Raypulse.png|[[DeFoe]] uses Honorguard\nS1E16 Lok Sophie Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard to protect [[Lok Lambert]]\nS2E37 Focauld Honorguard.png|[[Focauld Casterwill]] uses Honorguard\nS2E50 Sophie Shauna Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard against [[Shauna]]\n</gallery>","text":"S1E04 Sophie Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard to defend a water attack from the Gargoyle\nFile:S1E03 DeFoe Kreutalk Honorguard Zhalia Raypulse.png|DeFoe uses Honorguard\nS1E16 Lok Sophie Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard to protect Lok Lambert\nS2E37 Focauld Honorguard.png|Focauld Casterwill uses Honorguard\nS2E50 Sophie Shauna Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard against Shauna"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Garde-honneur\n|DUT=Erewacht\n|POR=Guarda de Horna\n}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Pink-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Honorguard is a defensive spell created by the Casterwill family. It manifests as a spherical barrier of orange and/or pink energy to defend against attacks. This spell is often used by members of the Casterwill family.\n\n== History ==\nSophie used Honorguard to protect herself from an attack of the Gargoyle in the Into the River of Secrets, but she was still thrown off by the powerful jet of water. [Into the River of Secrets]\n\nSophie used it to stop two Boltflare attacks simultaneously. \n\nHonorguard was shown to be ineffective against the Nullcurse power used by the Blood Spiral. [The Blood Spiral]\n\nFocauld Casterwill used this spell at the Cloisters to deflect a Raypulse back at a Silent Soldier. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\n==Trivia==\n* Although the spell is typically used by the Casterwill family, Defoe was shown to use it, albeit silently. [S1E03]\n\n==Gallery==\n\nS1E04 Sophie Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard to defend a water attack from the Gargoyle\nFile:S1E03 DeFoe Kreutalk Honorguard Zhalia Raypulse.png|DeFoe uses Honorguard\nS1E16 Lok Sophie Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard to protect Lok Lambert\nS2E37 Focauld Honorguard.png|Focauld Casterwill uses Honorguard\nS2E50 Sophie Shauna Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard against Shauna\n\n==International Names==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E04 Sophie Honorguard 1.png\n| aura  = Orange <br>Pink<br>Blue (TCG)\n| class = Protective\n| users = [[DeFoe]]<br>[[Focauld Casterwill]] <br> [[Lok Lambert]] ([[TCG:SAS-099|TCG]]) <br> [[Lucas Casterwill]]<br>[[Nimue Casterwill]] <br>[[Sophie Casterwill]]\n| first = \"[[Words of Truth, Heart of Lies]]\"\n}}\n'''Honorguard''' is a defensive spell created by the [[Casterwill family]]. It manifests as a spherical barrier of orange and/or pink energy to defend against attacks. This spell is often used by members of the [[Casterwill family]].\n\n== History ==\nSophie used Honorguard to protect herself from an attack of the [[Gargoyle]] in the [[Into the River of Secrets]], but she was still thrown off by the powerful jet of water. {{source|Into the River of Secrets}}\n\nSophie used it to stop two [[Boltflare]] attacks simultaneously. {{sourceneeded}}\n\nHonorguard was shown to be ineffective against the [[Nullcurse]] power used by the [[Blood Spiral]]. {{source|The Blood Spiral}}\n\n[[Focauld Casterwill]] used this spell at [[the Cloisters]] to deflect a [[Raypulse]] back at a [[Silent Soldier]]. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\n==Trivia==\n* Although the spell is typically used by the [[Casterwill family]], Defoe was shown to use it, albeit silently. {{Source|S1E03}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n==Gallery==\n{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nS1E04 Sophie Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard to defend a water attack from the [[Gargoyle]]\nFile:S1E03 DeFoe Kreutalk Honorguard Zhalia Raypulse.png|[[DeFoe]] uses Honorguard\nS1E16 Lok Sophie Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard to protect [[Lok Lambert]]\nS2E37 Focauld Honorguard.png|[[Focauld Casterwill]] uses Honorguard\nS2E50 Sophie Shauna Honorguard.png|Sophie uses Honorguard against [[Shauna]]\n</gallery>\n\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Garde-honneur\n|DUT=Erewacht\n|POR=Guarda de Horna\n}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Orange-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Pink-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Protective spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]","categories":["Casterwill family magic","Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Orange-aura spells","Pink-aura spells","Protective spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_id":"huntik:page:2048","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_title":"Focauld Casterwill","label":"Focauld Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:4514","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.co